<div>
    <p>
        <Center><strong><em><Big>Tribal Cards are for all financial transactions with OneState.</Big></em></strong></Center>

    </p>

    <center><img src="@Url.Content(Model.CardVendor)" height="120" width="240" alt="oops!" /></center>

</div>

<hr />

<center><h2>Member Participation</h2></center>

<center>

    <h3>Member Card</h3>

    <p>Member cards are for every induvidual member for everyday purchases inside our network.</p>

    <p>Since members are owners of OneFarm as a Co-Operative this card will also be used for any payouts to respective members.</p>

    <p class="title"><a href="/TribalCRM/Tribal/MemberInfo">More Info</a></p>

</center>




